#Сценарий_Change_Posting_Rule_РеализацияТоваров<[
Базис:
  OneBase trade demo conducts РеализацияТоваров through FIFO batches and writes movements to stock, batch, gross-profit and settlement registers.
  Golden path must change a real posting rule, but this design task must not edit OneBase code.
Вектор:
  Concrete rule change: add warehouse dimension to РеализацияТоваров gross-profit posting so ВаловаяПрибыль can be analyzed by Склад without changing FIFO cost logic.
  Before: the posting script writes ВаловаяПрибыль by Номенклатура with Выручка and Себестоимость only; reports/widgets can show gross profit by item and month, but cannot separate stores.
  After: the intended implementation records Склад from the document into ВаловаяПрибыль movements and the register/report can expose store-level gross profit while FIFO, inventory and buyer debt remain unchanged.
Цель:
  Give an agent one concrete OneBase business task: preserve FIFO posting while extending gross-profit analytics from item-only to item-by-warehouse.

Проверки:
  scenario identifies one exact posting-rule change
  affected OneBase artifacts and registers are listed
  expected before/after behavior is testable
  risk, rollback and agent task outline are present

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  domain.id: onebase
  onebase.document: РеализацияТоваров
  onebase.rule: gross-profit-by-warehouse
  work.source: onebase-posting-scenario-design
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Affected_Artifacts<[
Базис:
  The rule crosses metadata, posting script, accumulation registers and downstream reporting.
Вектор:
  Document YAML: ../onebase/examples/trade/documents/реализация_товаров.yaml declares posting=true, header fields Покупатель/Склад/Сумма and tablepart Товары with Номенклатура/Количество/Цена/Сумма.
  Posting script: ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os procedure ОбработкаПроведения already uses this.Склад for ОстаткиТоваров and writes ВаловаяПрибыль with Номенклатура, Выручка and Себестоимость.
  Register schema: ../onebase/examples/trade/registers/валовая_прибыль.yaml currently has dimension Номенклатура and resources Выручка/Себестоимость; the scenario expects Склад as an added dimension if verification confirms schema change is the right gate.
  Downstream readers: ../onebase/examples/trade/reports/валовая_прибыль.yaml and ../onebase/examples/trade/widgets/валовая_прибыль_kpi.yaml read РегистрНакопления.ВаловаяПрибыль; report grouping/filtering may need targeted update, KPI should remain total-compatible.
  Related registers preserved: ОстаткиТоваров расход by Номенклатура/Склад, ПартииТоваров расход by Номенклатура/ДатаПоставки, Взаиморасчеты приход by Контрагент/ТипКонтрагента.
Цель:
  The agent can open a bounded context slice instead of scanning all OneBase files.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  onebase.document_file: ../onebase/examples/trade/documents/реализация_товаров.yaml
  onebase.posting_script: ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os
  onebase.register.refs: ВаловаяПрибыль, ОстаткиТоваров, ПартииТоваров, Взаиморасчеты
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Expected_Behavior<[
Базис:
  A small posting-rule change is only useful if success and failure outcomes are unambiguous.
Вектор:
  Before: two РеализацияТоваров documents for the same Номенклатура from different Склад values aggregate together in ВаловаяПрибыль because the register has no Склад dimension.
  After: the same sales keep identical total Выручка, Себестоимость and ВаловаяПрибыль, but rows can be grouped or filtered by Склад.
  Invariants: FIFO order by ДатаПоставки is preserved, Строка.Сумма remains Количество * Цена, Себестоимость derives only from consumed batches, ОстаткиТоваров still uses this.Склад, and Взаиморасчеты.Сумма equals document total.
Цель:
  Verification can assert business behavior, not just file parsing.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  onebase.rule: gross-profit-by-warehouse
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Verification_Expectations<[
Базис:
  The next task selects the final command, but this scenario must state what evidence that command should prove.
Вектор:
  Minimum gate should parse or compile the edited YAML and .os artifacts.
  Preferred targeted scenario should post two sales for the same Номенклатура from different Склад values and assert separate ВаловаяПрибыль rows or grouping keys while preserving total profit.
  Failure evidence should include the command, working directory, exit code, touched artifacts and whether the failure is parser, runtime, assertion or fixture setup.
Цель:
  onebase-verification-command can choose a deterministic command without redesigning business expectations.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  work.next_action: onebase-verification-command
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Risk_Rollback<[
Базис:
  Posting changes can corrupt stock and profit if dimensions or cost values drift.
Вектор:
  Main risks: adding Склад to ВаловаяПрибыль can require data migration in real deployments, break report queries if grouping is incomplete, or accidentally alter FIFO cost/stock movements while touching the posting script.
  Rollback: revert changes to ../onebase/examples/trade/registers/валовая_прибыль.yaml, ../onebase/examples/trade/src/реализациятоваров.posting.os, gross-profit report/widget files and any scenario fixtures/tests created for this rule.
  Review boundary: any change to shared posting runtime, FIFO batch selection or non-gross-profit register schemas must become a separate Work Graph task because it expands blast radius beyond this golden path.
Цель:
  The implementation task stays small enough to review and safe to undo.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: onebase-change-posting-rule-risk-rollback
  workflow.id: onebase-change-posting-rule
  trace.status: verified
]>

